OL,3,AScottish government urges Glasgow City
OL,4,ACouncil to pause fire and rehire plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's deputy first minister has
OL,7,Fcalled on Glasgow City Council to pause
OL,8,Fits plans to fire and rehire workers.
OL,10,FJenny Gilruth said the Scottish
OL,11,Fgovernment did not support fire and
OL,12,Frehire schemes and urged the council
OL,13,Fand trade unions to get back around the
OL,14,Fnegotiating table.
OL,16,FThe council threatened to sack more
OL,17,Fthan 23,000 members of staff and then
OL,18,Frehire them on new contracts after
OL,19,Fnegotiations with unions over equal pay
OL,20,Fproposals broke down.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
