OL,3,AScottish government urges Glasgow City
OL,4,ACouncil to pause fire and rehire plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe talks were about the council's
OL,7,Fplans to replace a pay system found to
OL,8,Fdiscriminate against mostly women
OL,9,Fworkers. The changes would see the
OL,10,Fmajority of staff unaffected or better
OL,11,Foff, but they would cut pay for 11% of
OL,12,Fstaff.
